// 线程第 3a 步：发送（线程设计 §十八）。箭头函数的捕获在启动时深拷贝进新线程，堆类型的结果深拷贝回调用线程：
// 图内的共享与环保持原样；之后任何一方修改自己的那一份，另一方都看不到；模块级 let 每线程一份（新线程从初值
// 开始）；Error 结果原样作为 threadJoin 的错误返回。
struct Point {
    x: int,
    y: int,
}

struct Cell {
    v: int,
    next: Ref< Cell>?,
}

enum Shape {
    Circle(r: float),
    Poly(pts: List< Point>),
    Empty,
}

let counter: int = 100;

function bump(): int {
    counter = counter + 1;
    return counter;
}

function total(xs: List< int>): int {
    let s = 0;
    for (x in xs) {
        s = s + x;
    }
    return s;
}

function area(sh: Shape): string {
    return switch (sh) {
        case Circle(r) => "circle " + toStr(r),
        case Poly(pts) => "poly " + toStr(listLen(pts)),
        else => "empty",
    };
}

function main(args: []string): void {
    // 标量、字符串、List、定长数组、Bytes 的捕获；spawn 之后发送方继续改自己的 List，新线程看到的是 spawn 时的值。
    const name = "worker";
    const nums: List< int> = listNew();
    let i = 0;
    while (i < 1000) {
        listPush(nums, i);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    const arr = [1, 2, 3];
    const raw = bytesFromStr("abc");
    const t1 = threadSpawn((): string => name + " " + toStr(total(nums)) + " " + toStr(listLen(nums)) + " " + toStr(arr[2]) + " " + toStr(bytesLen(raw)));
    listPush(nums, 5000);
    print(threadJoin(t1) catch "join failed");
    print("main still has " + toStr(listLen(nums)));

    // 图内共享：同一个 Ref 在 List 里出现两次，新线程经第一个改字段，经第二个读到的是同一个对象。
    const p = new Point { x: 1, y: 2 };
    const ps: List< Ref< Point>> = listNew();
    listPush(ps, p);
    listPush(ps, p);
    const t2 = threadSpawn((): int => {
            const a = listGet(ps, 0) catch p;
            a.x = 99;
            const b = listGet(ps, 1) catch p;
            return b.x;
        });
    print("shared " + toStr(threadJoin(t2) catch -1) + " main sees " + toStr(p.x));

    // 环：两个 Cell 互指，新线程里沿 next 走两步回到起点（同一性保持）。
    const c1 = new Cell { v: 1, next: None };
    const c2 = new Cell { v: 2, next: c1 };
    c1.next = c2;
    const t3 = threadSpawn((): bool => {
            const b = c1.next catch c1;
            const a = b.next catch b;
            return a == c1 && b.v == 2;
        });
    print("cycle " + toStr(threadJoin(t3) catch false));

    // enum 与 struct 值的捕获；堆类型的结果（List、enum、struct、Ref）发送回来。
    const pts: List< Point> = listNew();
    listPush(pts, Point { x: 3, y: 4 });
    const shapes: List< Shape> = listNew();
    listPush(shapes, Shape.Circle(1.5));
    listPush(shapes, Shape.Poly(pts));
    listPush(shapes, Shape.Empty);
    const t4 = threadSpawn((): List< string> => {
            const out: List< string> = listNew();
            for (sh in shapes) {
                listPush(out, area(sh));
            }
            return out;
        });
    const none: List< string> = listNew();
    const names = threadJoin(t4) catch none;
    for (n in names) {
        print(n);
    }
    const t5 = threadSpawn((): Ref< Cell> => {
            const x = new Cell { v: 7, next: None };
            const y = new Cell { v: 8, next: x };
            x.next = y;
            return x;
        });
    const back = threadJoin(t5) catch c1;
    const nb = back.next catch back;
    const nn = nb.next catch nb;
    print("result cycle " + toStr(back.v) + " " + toStr(nb.v) + " " + toStr(nn == back));

    // 模块级 let 每线程一份：新线程从初值 100 开始，main 的修改与之无关。
    bump();
    bump();
    const t6 = threadSpawn((): int => bump());
    print("counter thread " + toStr(threadJoin(t6) catch -1) + " main " + toStr(counter));

    // Error 结果原样作为 threadJoin 的错误。
    const t7 = threadSpawn((): int | Error => {
            if (listLen(nums) > 0) {
                return err("boom " + name);
            }
            return 1;
        });
    const r7 = threadJoin(t7) catch (e) {
        print("error " + e.message);
        return;
    };
    print("unexpected " + toStr(r7));
}
